flowchart LR
  subgraph Hosting[Configured delivery: execution unverified]
    EVENTS[Main push or non-closed main pull request] --> CI[GitHub Actions]
    CI --> TOOLS[Workflow npm installs and OIDC token step]
    TOOLS --> AZ["Azure Static Web Apps upload: app /, output ., API empty"]
    CLOSED[Closed main pull request] --> CLOSE[Azure close action]
  end
  AZ -. configured static delivery .-> PAGE
  subgraph Runtime[Browser application: source-observed]
    PAGE[index.html] --> APP[app.js]
    MIC[Microphone permission and stream] --> AUDIO[Web Audio and local RMS]
    APP --> AUDIO
    AUDIO --> DOM[Turn timing and DOM feedback]
  end
  subgraph Authoring[Editor-only documentation tooling]
    PUML[HLD PlantUML source] --> SETTINGS[VS Code editor associations]
    SETTINGS --> EXT[Local custom editor extension]
    EXT --> PREVIEW[jebbs.plantuml preview command]
    PREVIEW -. README conditional requirement .-> JAVA[Java and configured renderer]
  end
